OL,3,GNEWSAEight held over Bromley KFC
OL,4,Amultiple stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight people have been questioned on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after a
OL,8,Fmultiple stabbing at a KFC restaurant
OL,9,Fin south-east London.
OL,11,FThe Met Police, ambulance service and
OL,12,Fair ambulance were called out to
OL,13,Freports of an altercation involving
OL,14,Fseveral people on Bromley High Street
OL,15,Fat about 14.15 BST on Thursday.
OL,17,FA 21-year-old man and three boys aged
OL,18,Fbetween 14 and 17 were taken to
OL,19,Fhospital with stab wounds. The man's
OL,20,Fcondition was previously critical but
OL,21,Fis now not thought to be
OL,22,Flife-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
